Keep short notes.

usage: notes [options] [file...]

options:
  -o, --output <value>  where to write (default -)
  -n, --count <n>       how many to show (default 10)
  -V, --verbose         say more
      --colour          use colour
  -t, --tag <value>...  filter by tag
      --format <value>  how to print (default text)
  -h, --help            show this help
  -v, --version         show the version

Keep short notes.

usage: notes <command> [options]

commands:
  add   add a note
  list  list notes

options:
  -o, --output <value>  where to write (default -)
  -n, --count <n>       how many to show (default 10)
  -V, --verbose         say more
      --colour          use colour
  -t, --tag <value>...  filter by tag
      --format <value>  how to print (default text)
  -h, --help            show this help
  -v, --version         show the version

add a note

usage: notes add [options]

options:
      --pin      keep it at the top
  -h, --help     show this help
  -v, --version  show the version

notes 1.2.0
cli ok
